# ripgrep/fd/ast-grep: Raven ships guidance under dot-directories, and all
# three tools share the same `ignore` crate, which skips them. These negations
# cover this repository's own installed `.agents/`, `.claude/`, `.codex/` and
# `.raven/` at the root. `common/.ignore` is a separate file with the same
# lines, shipped to installed projects (#238); because the tools read an
# `.ignore` per directory, it also covers the template sources beneath
# `common/` on its own.
!.agents/
!.claude/
!.codex/
!.raven/
